The discussion about vampires as a playable race in UnNetHack got me
thinking about Slash`EM, and although I don't play Slash`EM much, one
feature that I do like was the #technique command to access race and
role-specific special abilities.  I think that this is a fun feature,
and does much to differentiate the races and roles.

So, I'm curious how people feel about Slash`EM techniques.  Does
anyone have an interest in seeing a "port" of them to NetHack?  If so,
would you change any of the specifics, or carry them over as-is?


